<title>JAPAN: Kuwayama - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kuwayama - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.93		vs	   15.01</p>
<p> Operating	  855 million	 vs	    1.03</p>
<p> Current	    525 million	 vs	  734 million</p>
<p> Net		  384 million	 vs	  377 million</p>
<p> EPS		   37.08 yen	  vs	   48.41 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	   8 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  9.00 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kuwayama Corp is a major maker of precious metals and jewellrey.</p>
